<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian prime minister visits India.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian prime minister visits India.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethiopian Prime Minister Meles Zenawi left for India on Wednesday on a five-day state visit, state-run Ethiopian radio reported.</p>
<p>He was accompanied by Foreign Minister Seyoum Mesfin and Trade and Industry Minister Kasahun Ayele.</p>
